  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed replacement of four windows on the northeast and southwest elevations, by reason of their design, detailing and materials, would result in an unsympathetic alteration that fails to respect the architectural character of the host Grade II* Listed Building and the wider Southgate Green Conservation Area. The proposal would therefore cause harm to the character and appearance of the area, for which there is no public benefit identified. The proposal would be contrary to Section 16 of the National Planning Policy Framework 2024; Policy HC1 of the London Plan 2021; Policy 37 and 44 of the Enfield Development Management Document 2014; and Policy 31 of the Enfield Core Strategy 2010, and the Southgate Green Conservation Area Character Appraisal."
  ],
